<%- include('partials/head') %>
<main id="main">
  <section class="pageHero">
    <div class="container visualHero">
      <div class="pageHeroCopy">
        <span class="kicker">Infrastructure</span>
        <h1>Established datacentre capacity, delivered through VPN4U.</h1>
        <p>We are an independent service provider. We source compute and network capacity from established infrastructure partners and remain the customer-facing point of contact.</p>
      </div>
      <img class="pageArtwork" src="/images/hero-infrastructure.svg" alt="Illustration of connected datacentre and network services">
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="kicker">The model</span>
      <h2>Simple for the customer, specialised behind the scenes.</h2>
      <p style="max-width:760px;color:var(--muted)">Hosting and connectivity often involve datacentre operators, network carriers, hardware platforms and service providers. VPN4U combines those capabilities into a clearly described customer-facing service without pretending every underlying asset is owned by us.</p>
      <div class="simpleSteps">
        <article class="simpleStep"><span>01</span><h3>Infrastructure partners</h3><p>Established operators provide the underlying datacentre, compute or network capacity.</p></article>
        <article class="simpleStep"><span>02</span><h3>VPN4U packages the service</h3><p>We define the product, pricing, order process and customer-facing support model.</p></article>
        <article class="simpleStep"><span>03</span><h3>You deal with VPN4U</h3><p>Orders, provisioning communication and first-line support come through one provider.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section sectionMuted">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="kicker">Platforms</span>
      <h2>Three service types.</h2>
      <div class="serviceGrid">
        <article class="serviceCard"><img src="/images/vps.svg" alt="Virtual server illustration"><div class="serviceCardBody"><span class="tag">VPS</span><h3>Virtual compute</h3><p>NVMe virtual servers with public networking and regional deployment options.</p><a href="/vps">View VPS →</a></div></article>
        <article class="serviceCard"><img src="/images/dedicated.svg" alt="Dedicated server illustration"><div class="serviceCardBody"><span class="tag">Dedicated</span><h3>Bare metal</h3><p>Physical AMD compute for workloads that need predictable dedicated resources.</p><a href="/dedicated">View dedicated →</a></div></article>
        <article class="serviceCard"><img src="/images/vpn.svg" alt="VPN security illustration"><div class="serviceCardBody"><span class="tag">VPN</span><h3>Private connectivity</h3><p>Encrypted connectivity using established VPN protocols on supported plans.</p><a href="/vpn">View VPN →</a></div></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="kicker">Ordering</span>
      <h2>Availability is confirmed before payment.</h2>
      <div class="simpleTrust">
        <div><strong>Choose</strong><span>Select a standard plan or send a custom requirement.</span></div>
        <div><strong>Verify</strong><span>We check hardware, region and material configuration details.</span></div>
        <div><strong>Confirm</strong><span>The final specification and amount are confirmed before payment.</span></div>
        <div><strong>Provision</strong><span>Once accepted, the service is prepared and access details are delivered.</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section sectionMuted"><div class="container cta"><div><span class="kicker">Have a technical requirement?</span><h2>Describe it before you buy.</h2><p>Tell us the workload, region, compute, memory, storage and network requirements. We will confirm whether the standard catalogue fits.</p></div><a class="button" href="/contact">Contact sales</a></div></section>
</main>
<%- include('partials/footer') %>
